
Method execution operations.
USAGE:

CALL <method name> [<actual paramlist>]
NOTE: <actual paramlist> ::= <actual param> | <actual param>,  <actual paramlist>

The following alias verb(s)/method(s) are available:

Call			[ In/Out ]Params&type			Status
====			=====================			======
Admin                   [IN ]Options(STRING)                	(null)         

			[IN ]PackageLocation(STRING)        	

			[IN ]TargetLocation(STRING)         	

Advertise               [IN ]AllUsers(BOOLEAN)              	(null)         

			[IN ]Options(STRING)                	

			[IN ]PackageLocation(STRING)        	

Configure               [IN ]InstallLevel(UINT16)           	(null)         

			[IN ]InstallState(UINT16)           	

Install                 [IN ]AllUsers(BOOLEAN)              	(null)         

			[IN ]Options(STRING)                	

			[IN ]PackageLocation(STRING)        	

Reinstall               [IN ]ReinstallMode(UINT16)          	(null)         

Uninstall               					(null)         


Upgrade                 [IN ]Options(STRING)                	(null)         

			[IN ]PackageLocation(STRING)        	


